  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen first starting your game and opening up the Socials Tab in the Main Menu the Friend Locations Category will be selected. If you then decide to go to a different Category e.g. In Room, it will look like both Categories (Friend Locations and In Room) are selected, even though you are actually only viewing one Category (in this case the In Room Category).\nThis fixes it self by clicking on Friend Locations Category again, afterwards you can switch between the different Categories without it looking like Friend Locations is still selected.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a picture of Friends Locations looking as if I have it selected, even though I'm viewing the In Room Category:",
